Yosys 0.47 provides synth_quicklogic -family pp3 itself. EOS-S3 does not
need the old ql-qlf synthesis plugin, which is incompatible with this Yosys.
Keep ql-iob for the QuickLogic I/O passes used later in the flow.

--- a/f4pga/wrappers/tcl/eos-s3.f4pga.tcl
+++ b/f4pga/wrappers/tcl/eos-s3.f4pga.tcl
@@ -1,7 +1,6 @@
 yosys -import
 
 plugin -i ql-iob
-plugin -i ql-qlf
 
 yosys -import
 
